  "body": "Private viewings by appointment only for the BEST DEAL IN THE AREA! Ignore CV!\r\n\r\n- Fixed term tenancy for immediate return\r\n- Freehold title - no body corporate\r\n- Healthy Homes compliant\r\n- North-facing home with great natural light\r\n- Modern home with a character twist\r\n- Fully fenced for kids and pets\r\n- A few minutes to Kohimarama Beach and Mission Bay Beach\r\n\r\nA quietly confident home in one of Auckland's most enduring coastal neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nPositioned on freehold land along a leafy Mission Bay address, the home balances simplicity and sophistication with remarkable ease. Natural light defines the interiors, moving effortlessly through the north-facing living spaces and softening every room throughout the day.\r\n\r\nThe connection outdoors feels instinctive rather than designed. Elevated decking and private courtyard spaces create a sense of retreat rarely found at this level of the market, offering calm, privacy, and an understated elegance to everyday living.\r\n\r\nA modern kitchen with dedicated dining nook anchors the home, while recent updates bring a considered sense of permanence. Fresh finishes, LED lighting, mains pressure endless gas hot water, heat pump, Healthy Homes compliance, and practical storage contribute to a home that feels resolved and exceptionally easy to own.\r\n\r\nThere is a timelessness to this part of the Bays. Morning swims at Kohimarama, long walks along Tamaki Drive, waterfront cafes, and the quiet assurance of a neighbourhood that continues to hold its place among Auckland's most tightly regarded coastal enclaves.\r\n\r\nRarely does freehold ownership, sun, privacy, and walkability align so naturally.\r\n\r\nA home defined less by trends, and more by longevity.\r\n\r\nAgents bring your buyers, we offer conjunctional from day one.\r\n\r\nDownload the property documents here: https://www.agentsend.com/WOX7\r\n\r\nhttps://www.diego.nz/99a-selwynavenue",
